# 10 — Repository Map

> What lives where in **{{project.name}}**.

## Top-Level Layout

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `Cargo.toml` | Workspace root — defines crate members and shared dependencies |
| `rustfmt.toml` | Rust formatting configuration |
| `.darkhorse.yaml` | Dark Horse project configuration (provenance only) |
| `crates/` | All Rust crates (domain, application, infrastructure, desktop) |
{{#if project.features.frontend}}
| `frontend/` | Vite + TypeScript frontend UI |
{{/if}}
| `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-desktop/tauri.conf.json` | Tauri build configuration (lives alongside desktop crate) |
| `context/` | AI navigation layer (these files) |
| `openspec/` | Specifications, proposals, architecture rules, workflow docs |
| `.vscode/` | VS Code and MCP configuration |
| `.github/agents/` | GitHub Copilot agent definitions |

## Crate Map

| Crate | Layer | Path | Dependencies |
|-------|-------|------|--------------|
| `{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-domain` | Domain | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-domain/` | None (serde, chrono, uuid, thiserror only) |
| `{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-application` | Application | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-application/` | `{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-domain` |
| `{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-infrastructure` | Infrastructure | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-infrastructure/` | `{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-domain`, `{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-application` |
| `{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-desktop` | Presentation | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-desktop/` | All three above + Tauri |

## Dependency Direction

```
{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-infrastructure → {{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-application → {{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-domain
            ↓
{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-desktop ──────────────────→┘
```

Outer layers depend on inner layers. Never the reverse.

